# Alamat URL Backend FastAPI CampusFolio
# - Di Smartphone Fisik (Expo Go): Ganti dengan IP lokal Wi-Fi laptop Anda (contoh: http://192.168.1.50:8000/api/v1)
# - Di Android Emulator: Default otomatis http://10.0.2.2:8000/api/v1
# - Di iOS Simulator / Web: Default otomatis http://localhost:8000/api/v1
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/v1
